Third-party learning data
-------------------------
JMdict English-only Next Generation 1.10 (selected Japanese readings, written
forms, English meanings, and part-of-speech data) is provided by the Electronic
Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG):
https://www.edrdg.org/jmdict/j_jmdict.html
The JMdict Japanese and English components are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
The selected and transformed JMdict dataset is available under the same licence.
Onihayo's word selection, lesson grouping, and lesson notes are authored by
Onihayo contributors and licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. The exact source release,
checksum, transformations, and licence location are documented in
docs/content/sources.md and scripts/content/jmdict/README.md.

Every imported dataset is listed here with its source, licence, required
attribution, and repository path. The same attributions are shown to learners
on the site's licences page.
Process: docs/content/README.md. Register: docs/content/sources.md.

